      "text": "```\nDEFINITION:  F(s) = Σ_{n=1}^∞ a_n · n^{-s}   (s = σ + it ∈ C)"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-ANALYTIC-NUMBER-THEORY.md#006",
      "path": [
        "07-ANALYTIC-NUMBER-THEORY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:number-theory:07-analytic-number-theory, git-history:number-theory:07-analytic-number-theory]",
        "canonical_path": "number-theory/07-ANALYTIC-NUMBER-THEORY.md",
        "concepts": "[analytic, number, theory]",
        "current_path": "number-theory/07-ANALYTIC-NUMBER-THEORY.md",
        "id": "maxim:number-theory:analytic-number-theory",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "number-theory",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[analytic, number]",
        "section": "number-theory",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Analytic Number Theory",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Convergence: converges for Re(s) > σ_c (abscissa of convergence).\n  If a_n is bounded: σ_c ≤ 1.\n  If a_n = O(n^ε) for all ε>0: σ_c ≤ 1."
    },
    {
      "id": "07-ANALYTIC-NUMBER-THEORY.md#007",
      "path": [
        "07-ANALYTIC-NUMBER-THEORY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:number-theory:07-analytic-number-theory, git-history:number-theory:07-analytic-number-theory]",
        "canonical_path": "number-theory/07-ANALYTIC-NUMBER-THEORY.md",
        "concepts": "[analytic, number, theory]",
        "current_path": "number-theory/07-ANALYTIC-NUMBER-THEORY.md",
        "id": "maxim:number-theory:analytic-number-theory",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "number-theory",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[analytic, number]",
        "section": "number-theory",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Analytic Number Theory",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MULTIPLICATION (Dirichlet convolution):\n  If F(s) = Σ f(n)n^{-s} and G(s) = Σ g(n)n^{-s}, then\n  F(s)·G(s) = Σ (f*g)(n) n^{-s}   where (f*g)(n) = Σ_{d|n} f(d)g(n/d)"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-ANALYTIC-NUMBER-THEORY.md#008",
      "path": [
        "07-ANALYTIC-NUMBER-THEORY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:number-theory:07-analytic-number-theory, git-history:number-theory:07-analytic-number-theory]",
        "canonical_path": "number-theory/07-ANALYTIC-NUMBER-THEORY.md",
        "concepts": "[analytic, number, theory]",
        "current_path": "number-theory/07-ANALYTIC-NUMBER-THEORY.md",
        "id": "maxim:number-theory:analytic-number-theory",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "number-theory",
        "remap_from": "[]",
