      "text": "```\nζ(s) = Σ_{n=1}^∞ n^{-s}  (converges absolutely for Re(s) > 1)\n     = ∏_p (1 - p^{-s})^{-1}   (Euler product, Re(s) > 1)"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-ANALYTIC-NUMBER-THEORY.md#014",
