      },
      "text": "MDLOOM OF EULER PRODUCT:\n  ∏_p (1-p^{-s})^{-1} = ∏_p (1 + p^{-s} + p^{-2s} + ...)\n  Expanding: every positive integer n appears exactly once\n  (by unique factorization), contributing n^{-s}. □"
